11:["$","$L5","wie-versteckter-stress-ihrem-gedaechtnis-schadet",{"href":"/insights/wie-versteckter-stress-ihrem-gedaechtnis-schadet","className":"block group","children":["$","article",null,{"className":"border border-border bg-surface p-6 rounded-card hover:border-primary-accent transition-colors h-full flex flex-col","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-xl font-semibold text-text-primary mb-3 group-hover:text-primary-accent transition-colors","children":"Wie versteckter Stress Ihrem Gedächtnis schadet"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-text-muted mb-3","children":"2026"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-text-secondary line-clamp-3 mb-4 flex-grow","children":"Studien zeigen, dass unterdrückter Stress das Gedächtnis beeinträchtigen kann, dass das Gehirn entscheidet, ob Schmerz chronisch wird, und dass neue Technologien diese Prozesse sichtbar machen. Die Erkenntnisse eröffnen neue Wege für Therapie und Prävention."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-4","children":[[["$","span","Stress",{"className":"text-sm font-medium text-primary-accent bg-white px-2 py-1 rounded-editorial","children":"Stress"}],["$","span","Gedächtnis",{"className":"text-sm font-medium text-primary-accent bg-white px-2 py-1 rounded-editorial","children":"Gedächtnis"}],["$","span","Schmerz",{"className":"text-sm font-medium text-primary-accent bg-white px-2 py-1 rounded-editorial","children":"Schmerz"}]],["$","span",null,{"className":"text-sm text-text-muted","children":["+",2]}]]}],["$","span",null,{"className":"inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-medium text-primary-accent group-hover:gap-3 transition-all","children":["Weiterlesen",["$","svg",null,{"className":"w-4 h-4","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","children":["$","path",null,{"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","strokeWidth":2,"d":"M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3"}]}]]}]]}]}]
12:["$","$L5","ueber-oliven-fische-kuenstliche-neuronen",{"href":"/insights/ueber-oliven-fische-kuenstliche-neuronen","className":"block group","children":["$","article",null,{"className":"border border-border bg-surface p-6 rounded-card hover:border-primary-accent transition-colors h-full flex flex-col","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-xl font-semibold text-text-primary mb-3 group-hover:text-primary-accent transition-colors","children":"Über Oliven, Fische & künstliche Neuronen"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-text-muted mb-3","children":"2026"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-text-secondary line-clamp-3 mb-4 flex-grow","children":"Aktuelle Studien zeigen, dass unser Gehirn stärker von Ernährung, Technologie und individuellen biologischen Faktoren beeinflusst wird als bisher gedacht. Extra natives Olivenöl kann über den Darm die kognitive Leistung verbessern, künstliche Nervenzellen können erstmals direkt mit echten Gehirnzellen kommunizieren und Fischöl kann unter bestimmten Bedingungen sogar negative Effekte auf die Gehirnregeneration haben."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-4","children":[[["$","span","Olivenöl",{"className":"text-sm font-medium text-primary-accent bg-white px-2 py-1 rounded-editorial","children":"Olivenöl"}],["$","span","Darm-Hirn-Achse",{"className":"text-sm font-medium text-primary-accent bg-white px-2 py-1 rounded-editorial","children":"Darm-Hirn-Achse"}],["$","span","Künstliche Neuronen",{"className":"text-sm font-medium text-primary-accent bg-white px-2 py-1 rounded-editorial","children":"Künstliche Neuronen"}]],["$","span",null,{"className":"text-sm text-text-muted","children":["+",2]}]]}],["$","span",null,{"className":"inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-medium text-primary-accent group-hover:gap-3 transition-all","children":["Weiterlesen",["$","svg",null,{"className":"w-4 h-4","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","children":["$","path",null,{"strokeLinecap":